            "heading": "How to choose",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Fresh vs salt.</strong> Naturals and tungsten for trout/steelhead; synthetics and larger shanks for baitfish.</p><p><strong>Weight vs float.</strong> Slotted tungsten gets nymphs down; unweighted shanks and soft materials swim higher.</p><p>Jump to <a href=\"/collections/fly-tying-feathers\">feathers</a>, <a href=\"/collections/fly-tying-beads\">beads</a>, or <a href=\"/collections/fly-tying-shanks\">shanks</a> when you know the category.</p>"
          }
        },
