    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What\u2019s the difference between fly tying materials and supplies?",
            "row_content": "<p>Materials are what go on the hook\u2014feathers, beads, shanks, dubbing, flash. Supplies and tools (vises, scissors, adhesives) help you put them there. This hub focuses on materials; tools live in their own collection.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What should I buy for freshwater vs saltwater?",
            "row_content": "<p>Freshwater trout and steelhead: waterfowl feathers, dubbing, tungsten beads, jig and articulated shanks. Salt and baitfish: more synthetics, flash, larger shanks, and eyes.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where do you ship from?",
            "row_content": "<p>We ship nationwide from our Ilwaco, Washington shop. In-store inventory and web catalog overlap on core Spawn materials; some apparel ships via Printful.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are these materials on sale?",
            "row_content": "<p>This materials hub is full-price editorial. Timed Select-feather discounts (when running) live on the <a href=\"/collections/tying-room-clearance\">Labor Day Sale</a> collection\u2014not on this page.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
